cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Open Breast Ultrasound Research
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite the code and the dataset papers listed in
  docs/DATA_CARD.md. A DOI, repository URL, and release date are omitted on
  purpose until a real public release exists.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Stanisic
    given-names: Srdjan
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Research prototype that inventories breast ultrasound images and can train
  an EfficientNetB0 three-class whole-image classifier. Not a medical device.
  Classification performance has not been evaluated in this release.
